<h2>Centroid-based token prediction</h2>
<p>
  Computing logits over a 256K-token vocabulary requires a <code>Linear(768, 256000)</code> matrix multiply — expensive for a small draft model. <code>Gemma4AssistantMaskedEmbedder</code> avoids this by <strong>clustering vocabulary tokens into centroids</strong> and only scoring the top-K clusters.
</p>

